# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Helper function (conceptual) – each measurement is expressed by:
#   * a Measurement individual
#   * an OutputRole linking the process to the measurement
#   * a MeasurementProcess linking patient role, output role, status and time
# -----------------------------------------------------------------

